# jobpipe schedule. Times are container-local (TZ=Asia/Kolkata, set in the
# Dockerfile), so these are IST and they do not drift.
#
# Weekdays only: applying on a Sunday morning puts you at the bottom of a
# Monday inbox. One full run at 07:00 leaves the queue waiting when you sit
# down with coffee.
#
# min hour dom mon dow  command
   0   7    *   *  1-5  python -m jobpipe.cli ingest && python -m jobpipe.cli score && python -m jobpipe.cli prepare && python -m jobpipe.cli notify

# Reply tracking is cheap and worth running more often than the pipeline.
   0  13    *   *  1-5  python -m jobpipe.cli track
   0  19    *   *  1-5  python -m jobpipe.cli track
